\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 8900010 (AMR-088-0010). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
